Significance: minor
Type: add

Export the site's look on rows of its own, item by item — Customizer theme mods and custom CSS rules, the Site Editor's style groups and CSS rules, widgets (classic and block) — with a preview of each and the media they use. On import, CSS rules are added to the other site's CSS (at the end, at the start, or replacing it) between head/tail comments named after the file; theme mods, style groups and widgets join the other site's instead of replacing them.
